    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d705">

                <pb facs="0736" n="726" xml:id="pg726"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">834.01/39: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Paraguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Howard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-17T18:00:00-04:00">August 17, 1937—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>12. Your no. 23, August 17, 11 a.m. arrived too late to enable the Department to
                    give you instructions. Please report what took place at the meeting this
                    afternoon, which it is presumed in the absence of specific instructions you did
                    not attend.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
